section.one-info
  h2.section-header Judicial Committee
  p JudComm is the judiciary branch of our dorm government. Its members provide arbitration in disputes and enforce dorm rules (of which there are very few). Most dorm problems can be handled internally, generally without even involving JudComm.
  p JudComm members are elected in September.
